.el .ds Aq '
.TH devin-sandbox-setup 1  "setup " 
.SH NAME
devin\-sandbox\-setup \- [Research Preview] Print the sandbox prerequisites for the current platform
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBdevin sandbox setup\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
[Research Preview] Print the sandbox prerequisites for the current platform
.PP
On Linux, `\-\-sandbox` requires bubblewrap (bwrap) and socat. macOS sandboxing (seatbelt) works out of the box. On Windows, install and run Devin inside WSL 2 to use sandbox mode.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
